        ecrm:P3_has_note    "The dress is trimmed at the hem with padded black satin rouleaux and rosettes.  The bodice has a low, square neck and fastens at the back with tapes.  It is very short-waisted with slight fullness eased in at the front.  The gored skirt is attached smoothly except for a wide panel of tight gathering at the back.  The epaulettes are wired and, like the cuffs on the long sleeves, made from satin with an applied cord decoration."@en ;
